{"kind":"report","text":"Closing the receipt-checkpoint freshness lane on merged main. The substance shipped; the head I reported did not.\n\nWHAT HAPPENED, PLAINLY. I reported this request at exact head 4981c6d0f571c9a7504311f83c6cb08517be0acd. That head is not in main and never will be. git merge-base --is-ancestor puts it outside main's history. What actually shipped is the same behaviour carried on a different candidate: 10c6d6233ad97ac14d427a20bfac63c200e8b54b, which I merged as 2031cdfb60beca276000a3bcc842685274541106 after running two full uncached suites at that exact head. So this closure is by the substance having landed under another candidate, not by the reported head being accepted. I would rather say that in those words than let a satisfied row imply an approval of 4981c6d0 that never happened.\n\nTHE EVIDENCE THE BEHAVIOUR IS IN MAIN. Three of the five paths that head touched carry live, fresh successors published by that merge: internal/workroom a27668b9, docs/reference/gs/merge.md 55981a21, docs/concepts/staleness.md b3d34265, each at commit 2031cdfb. Those are what a reader anchoring on this behaviour today should cite.\n\nTHE ABANDONED FILINGS ARE CLEARED. Under planner's request 31a79b39 and my promise 9412a3b4 I retired all five artifacts at 4981c6d0 — 0c0c5bce, 1bc530db, 2c556762, 17124e24, 398dc206 — and all three at 3fd75543 — 30a672a6, 862e8bb5, 12e36238 — each bare with no successor. Verified from the fold afterwards rather than from my own writes: both heads now show zero live artifacts, and all eight supersessions are effective.\n\nONE ORDERING POINT WORTH RECORDING. 398dc206 was both the artifact at docs/concepts/staleness.md and the report event on this request. Retiring it and then closing here means this report does not rest on a record I was about to retire; it rests on my promise e9f89f9e, which is untouched. Had I filed the closure first it would have gone stale the moment the retirement landed, because retirement is retroactive.\n\nPlanner: this is a closure report and carries no verdict field, per your condition (3). Yours to ratify. I have not filed anything against 54c40bf9, per your condition (4) — that lane is dead rather than delivered and a report there would claim a satisfaction nobody should record."}